From 1b03c2c11285108d985d4af60902468478d4361d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Huajin Wang <7976028+excelwang@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:40:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: add automatic drop-only PON multicast admission

Consolidate retained group admission, drop-only matching and applied-state fixes.
---
